<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
    --forest: #142018;
    --forest-2: #233529;
    --moss: #6f8064;
    --sage: #d6dccb;
    --canvas: #f7f1e4;
    --paper: #fffaf0;
    --ink: #1f261f;
    --muted: #687060;
    --line: rgba(31, 38, 31, .14);
    --gold: #d9b86f;
    --clay: #b76e4b;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .trailnest-home * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .trailnest-home { overflow: hidden; background: var(--paper); }
  .tn-wrap { width: min(1200px, calc(100% - 32px)); margin: 0 auto; }
  .tn-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--clay);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .tn-button {
    min-height: 54px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0 22px;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 950;
    transition: transform .18s ease, background .18s ease, border-color .18s ease;
  }
  .tn-button:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .tn-button-primary { color: var(--forest); background: var(--gold); }
  .tn-button-secondary { color: var(--paper); border-color: rgba(255,250,240,.34); background: rgba(255,250,240,.08); }

  .tn-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 86vh;
    display: grid;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 86px 0 72px;
    color: var(--paper);
    background: var(--forest);
  }
  .tn-hero-media { position: absolute; inset: 0; }
  .tn-hero-media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: .54; }
  .tn-hero::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(20,32,24,.98), rgba(20,32,24,.74) 48%, rgba(20,32,24,.28));
  }
  .tn-hero .tn-wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .tn-hero-content { max-width: 760px; }
  .tn-badge {
    width: max-content;
    max-width: 100%;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 8px 13px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,250,240,.26);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(20,32,24,.62);
    color: #f5ead2;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 850;
  }
  .tn-badge span { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--gold); }
  .tn-hero h1 {
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 88px);
    line-height: .98;
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .tn-hero h1 em { color: var(--gold); font-style: normal; }
  .tn-hero-copy {
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    max-width: 650px;
    color: #e5dbc7;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.7vw, 21px);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .tn-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 32px; }

  .tn-strip { background: var(--forest); color: var(--paper); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,250,240,.16); }
  .tn-strip-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .tn-strip-item { min-height: 132px; padding: 24px; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,250,240,.14); display: grid; align-content: center; }
  .tn-strip-item:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .tn-strip-item strong { display: block; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1; color: var(--gold); }
  .tn-strip-item span { display: block; margin-top: 10px; color: #d8d0bd; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.45; }

  .tn-section { padding: 96px 0; }
  .tn-section.green { background: var(--forest); color: var(--paper); }
  .tn-head { max-width: 820px; margin-bottom: 38px; }
  .tn-head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4.8vw, 58px); line-height: 1.04; font-weight: 950; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .tn-head p { margin: 18px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .green .tn-head p { color: #d8d0bd; }

  .tn-living-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  .tn-living-card { min-height: 470px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--forest); color: var(--paper); }
  .tn-living-card img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: .72; transition: transform .3s ease; }
  .tn-living-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.025); }
  .tn-living-card::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(20,32,24,.92)); }
  .tn-living-card-content { position: absolute; left: 24px; right: 24px; bottom: 24px; z-index: 1; }
  .tn-living-card h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.08; font-weight: 950; }
  .tn-living-card p { margin: 12px 0 0; color: #e5dbc7; line-height: 1.58; }

  .tn-promise { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr); gap: 18px; align-items: stretch; }
  .tn-promise-panel { padding: 32px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,250,240,.18); border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(255,250,240,.07); }
  .tn-promise-panel h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.08; font-weight: 950; }
  .tn-promise-panel p { margin: 16px 0 0; color: #d8d0bd; line-height: 1.7; }
  .tn-checks { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .tn-check { padding: 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,250,240,.16); border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(255,250,240,.06); }
  .tn-check b { display: block; color: var(--gold); font-size: 18px; }
  .tn-check span { display: block; margin-top: 8px; color: #d8d0bd; line-height: 1.55; }

  .tn-gear-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  .tn-gear-card { min-height: 250px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(31,38,31,.06); }
  .tn-gear-card .tag { width: 46px; height: 46px; display: grid; place-items: center; margin-bottom: 28px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--sage); color: var(--forest); font-weight: 950; }
  .tn-gear-card h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 950; }
  .tn-gear-card p { margin: 12px 0 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }

  .tn-story { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, .95fr); gap: 34px; align-items: center; }
  .tn-story img { width: 100%; min-height: 520px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 8px; }
  .tn-story-copy h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(34px, 4.8vw, 58px); line-height: 1.04; font-weight: 950; }
  .tn-story-copy p { margin: 18px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; }

  .tn-final { padding: 88px 0; background: var(--forest); color: var(--paper); }
  .tn-final-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 28px; align-items: center; }
  .tn-final h2 { margin: 0; max-width: 760px; font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 64px); line-height: 1.02; font-weight: 950; }
  .tn-final p { margin: 16px 0 0; max-width: 660px; color: #d8d0bd; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.62; }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .tn-living-grid, .tn-promise, .tn-story, .tn-final-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .tn-gear-grid, .tn-strip-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .tn-wrap { width: min(100% - 24px, 1200px); }
    .tn-hero { min-height: auto; padding: 62px 0; }
    .tn-actions, .tn-button { width: 100%; }
    .tn-strip-grid, .tn-gear-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .tn-section { padding: 68px 0; }
    .tn-living-card { min-height: 390px; }
    .tn-story img { min-height: 360px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="trailnest-home">
  <section class="tn-hero">
    <div class="tn-hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=82" alt="">
    </div>
    <div class="tn-wrap">
      <div class="tn-hero-content">
        <div class="tn-badge"><span></span> Practical gear for outdoor life</div>
        <h1>Pack lighter. Camp warmer. Travel with <em>confidence.</em></h1>
        <p class="tn-hero-copy">TrailNest equips road trips, campouts, and everyday outdoor living with reliable essentials made for comfort, order, and calm in the open air.</p>
        <div class="tn-actions">
          <a class="tn-button tn-button-primary" href="/collections/all">Shop Outdoor Gear</a>
          <a class="tn-button tn-button-secondary" href="/pages/about-trailnest">Our Story</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tn-strip">
    <div class="tn-wrap tn-strip-grid">
      <div class="tn-strip-item"><strong>Travel</strong><span>Essentials that make packing, storing, and moving feel simpler.</span></div>
      <div class="tn-strip-item"><strong>Camp</strong><span>Comfort-forward gear for nights outside and slow mornings.</span></div>
      <div class="tn-strip-item"><strong>Live</strong><span>Outdoor pieces that work on the trail, patio, and weekend basecamp.</span></div>
      <div class="tn-strip-item"><strong>Trust</strong><span>Built around dependable materials and practical details.</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="trailnest-living" class="tn-section">
    <div class="tn-wrap">
      <div class="tn-head">
        <p class="tn-kicker">Outdoor living, made easier</p>
        <h2>Gear for the moments between leaving home and settling in.</h2>
        <p>TrailNest focuses on the real needs of American travelers: organized packing, comfortable camp setups, durable utility, and products that feel natural in the places you actually go.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tn-living-grid">
        <article class="tn-living-card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516939884455-1445c8652f83?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=82" alt="Packed vehicle ready for an outdoor road trip">
          <div class="tn-living-card-content"><h3>Road trip ready</h3><p>Keep the essentials close, the cabin organized, and the day moving smoothly.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="tn-living-card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504280390367-361c6d9f38f4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=82" alt="Warm campsite at dusk">
          <div class="tn-living-card-content"><h3>Camp comfort</h3><p>Reliable pieces for setting up, winding down, and sleeping better outdoors.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="tn-living-card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1445307806294-bff7f67ff225?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=82" alt="Outdoor table with gear and warm light">
          <div class="tn-living-card-content"><h3>Open-air living</h3><p>Simple, capable gear that earns a place in everyday outdoor routines.</p></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tn-section green">
    <div class="tn-wrap tn-promise">
      <div class="tn-promise-panel">
        <p class="tn-kicker">The TrailNest promise</p>
        <h3>Natural, reliable, and warm by design.</h3>
        <p>We build around a simple idea: outdoor gear should reduce friction. It should help you pack smarter, stay comfortable, and feel ready without adding bulk, noise, or fuss.</p>
        <p>From weekend camping to long highway miles, TrailNest is made for people who want dependable tools with a quieter, more refined point of view.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tn-checks">
        <div class="tn-check"><b>Useful first</b><span>Every feature needs a job, from storage details to weather-aware materials.</span></div>
        <div class="tn-check"><b>Built for repeat trips</b><span>Durability matters because the best gear keeps showing up season after season.</span></div>
        <div class="tn-check"><b>Warm, not loud</b><span>A grounded palette and clean design help the gear feel at home outdoors.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tn-section">
    <div class="tn-wrap">
      <div class="tn-head">
        <p class="tn-kicker">Shop by need</p>
        <h2>Practical essentials for travel, camping, and outdoor life.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="tn-gear-grid">
        <div class="tn-gear-card"><span class="tag">01</span><h3>Packing and storage</h3><p>Keep gear visible, reachable, and ready for the next stop.</p></div>
        <div class="tn-gear-card"><span class="tag">02</span><h3>Camp setup</h3><p>Make basecamp calmer with pieces that support comfort and order.</p></div>
        <div class="tn-gear-card"><span class="tag">03</span><h3>Travel utility</h3><p>Reliable tools for long drives, quick stops, and changing weather.</p></div>
        <div class="tn-gear-card"><span class="tag">04</span><h3>Outdoor comfort</h3><p>Small upgrades that make more time outside feel easier to enjoy.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tn-section">
    <div class="tn-wrap tn-story">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1478131143081-80f7f84ca84d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=82" alt="Tent and campsite surrounded by trees">
      <div class="tn-story-copy">
        <p class="tn-kicker">About TrailNest</p>
        <h2>Made for the way people really get outside.</h2>
        <p>Not every adventure is extreme. Some are a family weekend, a sunrise drive, a better organized trunk, or a quiet night at camp. TrailNest creates gear for those real outdoor moments.</p>
        <p>Our products are selected for practical value, dependable construction, and a warm outdoor aesthetic that fits naturally into American travel and camping culture.</p>
        <div class="tn-actions"><a class="tn-button tn-button-primary" href="/pages/about-trailnest">Read the Brand Story</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tn-final">
    <div class="tn-wrap tn-final-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="tn-kicker">Start your next outdoor routine</p>
        <h2>Build a kit that makes leaving home feel easy.</h2>
        <p>Explore TrailNest gear for travel, camping, and the comfortable outdoor life you want to keep returning to.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="tn-button tn-button-primary" href="/collections/all">Shop TrailNest</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

